feat(dashboard): Gaze Insights page, Gaze Live rebrand, shared theme, HTS deck

Dashboard rename + multipage restructure
- Rename dashboard/app.py -> dashboard/📺_Gaze_Live.py (Streamlit sidebar
  picks up the emoji + label directly from the filename)
- Extract inline CSS into new dashboard/theme.py; inject_theme() is
  shared across pages so sidebar nav, widgets and typography stay
  consistent
- Update page_title, page_icon, hero title to
  "Gaze Analytics — Signage Engagement"
- Update the 4 external references: deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml,
  scripts/run_all.ps1, .github/skills/run-dashboard/SKILL.md,
  docs/ARCHITECTURE.md

New Gaze Insights page (dashboard/pages/2_👁️_Gaze_Insights.py)
- Layer 1: KPI strip — Impressions, Attention time, Avg viewing
  duration, Attention rate, M/F ratio with deltas vs prior window
- Layer 2: Audience engagement trend, auto-rebinned 5s → 1min → 15min
  → 1h based on the selected window
- Layer 2b: Top content by attention time — leaderboard with
  data-URL thumbnails and progress bars
- Layer 3: Gender split donut (full width; recent-segments table
  removed per user feedback)

Business layer (dashboard/business.py)
- Aggregate-only SQL for gaze_kpis, top_by_attention_time,
  insights_kpis, all_segments, classify_quadrants,
  top_by_impressions, bottom_by_attention
- GazeKpis dataclass now carries attention_time_seconds plus deltas
  vs the equal-length prior window

Tests
- 17 new tests in tests/test_business.py cover gaze_kpis,
  top_by_attention_time and empty/missing-DB edge cases
- tests/test_dashboard_process.py: extend _FakeProc mock with
  children/is_running/kill and patch psutil.wait_procs for the
  Windows tree-kill path added upstream
- 121 tests pass, ruff clean on all new code

Presentation
- Reproducible pitch deck at presentations/GazeAnalytics_HackTheStack.pptx
- Generator: scripts/make_hack_the_stack_deck.py (python-pptx is a
  dev-only convenience and is NOT tracked in pyproject.toml)

Housekeeping
- .gitignore: streamlit.out.log, streamlit.err.log, .gitmsg.tmp

Privacy contract unchanged: no frames written, no face recognition,
no embeddings, no cloud calls. Only aggregate rows leave the pipeline.
